---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Fresh Petals Hyderabad"
  description="Fresh Petals Hyderabad terms of service for flower orders, WhatsApp checkout, delivery, pricing, cancellations and customer responsibilities."
>
  <main class="bg-white">
    <section class="px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[#9B6B78]">
            Fresh Petals Hyderabad
          </p>

          <h1 class="fp-serif mt-3 text-3xl uppercase tracking-[0.20em] text-[#171717] md:text-5xl">
            Terms of Service
          </h1>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D] md:text-base">
            These terms apply when you browse Fresh Petals Hyderabad, add products to cart, send enquiries, or place flower orders through WhatsApp.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Order Confirmation
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Adding a product to cart or sending an enquiry on WhatsApp does not automatically confirm the order. Orders are confirmed only after Fresh Petals confirms product availability, final price, delivery fee, delivery time slot and payment details on WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Pricing and Market Availability
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Flower prices may vary based on daily market rates, seasonality, flower quality, festival demand, sourcing cost and availability. Prices shown on the website may be starting prices, estimated prices or market-price indicators. Final price will be confirmed before payment.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Product Variations
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Fresh flowers are natural products. Colour, size, bloom stage, arrangement style and filler flowers may vary depending on availability. We try to match the product look and feel as closely as possible, but exact replication may not always be possible.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Delivery
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Delivery depends on pincode, distance, route feasibility, product type, order value and delivery slot. Delivery fees shown on the website are estimates for supported areas. Final delivery fee and slot confirmation will happen on WhatsApp before order confirmation.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Customer Responsibility
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              <p>Customers are responsible for sharing accurate details such as:</p>

              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li>• Name and phone number</li>
                <li>• Delivery address and pincode</li>
                <li>• Apartment, flat number, landmark or gate instructions</li>
                <li>• Delivery date and preferred time slot</li>
                <li>• Occasion notes, preferred flowers or gift message</li>
              </ul>

              <p>
                Fresh Petals is not responsible for failed or delayed delivery caused by incorrect address, customer unavailability, security restrictions or unreachable phone number.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Cancellations
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Cancellation requests may be accepted only before sourcing or preparation begins. For same-day orders, custom bouquets, pooja flowers, jasmine, garlands, poola jada, bulk flowers and event orders, cancellation may not be possible once sourcing or preparation has started.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Refunds and Replacements
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Refunds and replacements are handled as per the Fresh Petals Refund Policy. Since flowers are perishable, every issue is reviewed based on order type, delivery status, photos/videos shared by the customer and timing of the complaint.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Payments
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Payment details will be shared only after order confirmation. Customers should not share OTPs, banking passwords or sensitive financial information. Fresh Petals may use UPI or other payment methods based on order confirmation.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Bulk, Event and Custom Orders
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Bulk orders, temple flowers, garlands, wedding flowers, event flowers, poola jada and custom floral work require manual discussion. Prices, sourcing time, delivery charges, labour charges and payment terms may differ from regular product listings.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Website Usage
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              The Fresh Petals website is used for browsing products, preparing cart orders and sending order details to WhatsApp. Product images, content, design and brand material should not be copied or reused without permission.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Changes to Terms
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Fresh Petals may update these terms as the business, website, payment options, delivery process or order flow evolves. Updated terms will be available on this page.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] border border-[#E8D8DE] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
            Need clarification?
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
            Message Fresh Petals on WhatsApp before placing your order.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919652012274?text=Hi%20Fresh%20Petals%2C%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20your%20terms%20of%20service."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#075838] px-7 py-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#7C243E]"
          >
            Ask on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>